WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:16.740
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:27.750
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:33.280
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:38.790
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:43.770
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:49.570
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:54.600
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.710 --> 00:01:00.010
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:11.330
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:23.510
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.710
"Jirikihongan Temple"

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:32.970
Well, I'm sure it'll work
out somehow.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:36.020
Sir, not that again!

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:43.790
Do you know the nicknames the other
stations have given to Bokuto?

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:45.290
No, sir...

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:49.460
Well, there's "autonomous brigade..."
that's one of the nicer ones.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:52.060
Another station refers to
you as a "trade show."

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.900
And I've even heard you being
called a "wild safari!"

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.470
Well, we'll take that
as a compliment.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.440
So... when does that
new officer start?

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:03.810
Sir?

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.950
Oh, I can hardly wait
for this one!

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:14.360
"Women's Locker Room"

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.890
Hey! Hey, listen! I've
got big news!

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:20.390
There she goes
again!

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:24.660
Yoriko's "big news" always becomes
our "big headache!"

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.270
A young man will be joining us!

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:31.560
What?!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.010
Wanna know?

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:36.000
Yeah!

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:39.620
He's 172 cm tall,
weighs 53 kg...

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.240
Cancer is his sign, and
his blood type is AB.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:45.080
He passed the police academy exams
straight out of high school.

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:46.990
He comes to us from
Jonan Station...

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:48.420
...where he received 7 commendations
from his Station Chief...

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:50.550
...and 2 Distinguished Service Commen-
dations by the Chief of Police.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:54.290
He's got a Class A driver's license.
Level 2 English Proficiency...

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.130
Abacus skills, 1st Class.
Calligraphy, 2nd Grade.

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:59.860
Music is his hobby. Loves playing
guitar. Had a rock band once.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.270
He swims and plays
golf and basketball.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.860
"Everything okay..."
I say!

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:08.570
Rumor has it that his family
has serious money.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:13.910
They're huge!

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.550
He's an only son, and his uncle
is a Prefectural Commissioner.

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:18.680
He's your one-stop ticket
to matrimonial bliss!

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:27.860
And his name is
Aoi Futaba.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.900
Yes?

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:35.090
"Yes?!"

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.630
I'm Aoi Futaba. I've just
been transferred here.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:41.010
Nice to meet you.

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:54.320
FILE.5
A BEAUTY TO BE
RECKONED WITH -
HER NAME IS AOI

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.990
This is Aoi
Futaba.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:01.760
She... er... He... er...

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:04.590
He wasn't always
like this.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.730
"Chikan;" men Who secretly molest
Women (ie; on a croWded train)
He served as a decoy in
our Anti-Chikan unit.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.100
So I suppose that kind of work
is all that he's been doing?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:18.280
Because of this, he has become used
to behaving like a policewoman.

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:20.940
So, what can I say?
That's how it is.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:24.110
This is all new to me, and I greatly
appreciate any help you can give.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:28.460
Well, as for the changing
rooms...

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:32.360
Obviously... We expect HIM
to use the male facilities!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.360
Well, yes...

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:37.830
"Men's Locker Room"

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:47.130
So, he wears boxer shorts
under that skirt...

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:50.940
If you think of it as playing dress up,
it's really no big deal. Not at all...

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:10.490
No matter what he looks like,
he is a man, after all...

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:15.030
Well, I have to say that it affects the...
um... morale of the men...

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.370
So, I think...

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:17.110
Pervert!

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:20.270
No, I'm just trying to make a point
about maintaining discipline...

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:24.180
I don't think you have the right to speak,
what with that nosebleed of yours.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:27.280
What does that have to
do with anything?

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.590
I'm sorry, but we can't allow you
to use our changing room.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:34.660
I understand.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.030
Sorry, but the same goes for us.

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:36.580
Yeah!

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:38.450
All right.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:41.600
There's no way
around this.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.630
So, I guess you can use my
room, and share with me.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:45.970
What?!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.990
That should solve everybody's problem.

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:50.940
There's no way she should be
allowed to change with you.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.700
Come on, it's okay.
They're both men.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.880
Then she should be made to
use the male change room.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:56.180
That's right!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:56.680
Yeah!

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:59.170
That's right.

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:00.950
No way!

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:02.450
Figures!

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:03.190
I don't mind.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:05.180
The morning is too early for this stuff...

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:11.290
Ahh! Come on!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:16.420
All he has to do is go back
to being a man, right?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.600
Well...

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:21.070
Huh?

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:22.660
What do you think?

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.940
It doesn't suit you...

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.170
It's been a while since
I dressed as a man.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.850
It's embarrassing.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.750
That's embarrassing...

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:36.180
She actually looks better in a skirt.

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:45.050
That's impressive!

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.790
It's nothing,
really...

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:50.420
Umm... Now, you
have to try it!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.630
Well, your form
isn't too bad...

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.640
Indeed...

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.340
Oww...

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:08.710
Come on, even Yoriko
can shoot properly.

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:10.850
Oh, my skirt!

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.480
"Wisdom and Courage"

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.360
Don't hold back,
Nakajima.

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:25.360
Yeah, right.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.440
And don't get
a nosebleed.

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:29.570
Leave me alone!

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:31.830
Begin!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.980
YAAAARGH!

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:37.510
yarg...

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.240
This isn't going
to work.

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:41.140
Get it together,
you two!

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:43.110
Right, here
goes!

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:00.900
Get up.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.140
Why did you scream?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:06.010
Why did you scream?
'Cause, I was so afraid!

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:09.170
"Bokuto Police Station"

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.640
It's completely
useless.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.270
We might have to start from scratch,
starting with the way he talks.

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:16.710
That'll take a gazillion
years!

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:19.150
Is he going to keep on using the
Chief's room all that time?

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.820
There's no such thing
as a "gazillion."

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:24.150
But... this really is becoming
a problem.

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:27.320
Who would've
thought?

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:29.990
Hey, this tastes
great!

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:31.660
Thank you very
much.

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:38.370
I really appreciate all that
you're doing for me.

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:42.640
I'm sorry... If only I were
more... more like a man.

00:08:43.150 --> 00:08:46.140
"judo-gi;" judo uniform.
Hey, does anyone know
where my judo-gi is?

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:49.620
Oh, I washed
it for you.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:57.650
Does someone have the
keys to the dojo?

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:02.150
I have them. I was just
cleaning up in there.

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:07.260
There's even a little
doll attached.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.130
The string
is knitted.

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:13.500
I figured I should at least do
what I know I'm capable of.

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:15.440
When did you start doing laundry,
and crafts and such?

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:21.150
Well, I felt that I had to become more of
a woman inside, not just look like one.

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.450
Otherwise, I wouldn't have been
able to trap the chikans.

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:26.920
You mean you've been practicing the tea
ceremony, flower arranging, and so on?

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:29.390
Like kimono, table
manners?

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.030
And playing with beanbags
and marbles?

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:35.930
Yes. I have studied everything a
woman is supposed to know.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.100
You're a better woman
than I am...

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:42.360
You are diligent and serious about
your work, aren't you?

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:45.440
It's just that... you're going
in a different direction.

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:03.880
Excuse me. I heard that an Aoi
Futaba may be stationed here.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.970
Who would you be? And
what does it concern?

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:19.760
My name is Reiko Katsui. I was
his junior in high school.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:23.270
My little brother's gotten mixed up
with some dangerous people.

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.820
Actually, she just
went that way...

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.150
"She?"

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.660
But first, can I ask
you a few things?

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.660
I can't come out.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:40.560
It's better that
I stay here.

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:42.490
Why's that?

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:45.330
It's because...
well...

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:49.300
Is it because you're embarrassed
to be dressed as a woman?

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:53.230
I think it would be better
if you came out now.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:57.240
Besides, this is the
ladies room.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.480
"Sempai;" A mentor, big-brother figure, etc.
You mean Aoi-sempai?

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.020
What was he like
in high school?

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.480
I guess he was kind
of different.

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:08.560
No, not really. But he
was really cool.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.450
"Cool?"

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:14.620
Even now, there still hasn't been a
better basketball player than him.

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:19.460
The MVP Award he got three
years in a row is legendary.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:23.240
On graduation day, he gave me his sec-
ond button and basketball shoes.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:25.470
I will treasure them for
the rest of my life.

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:28.040
Wow...

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:32.740
Then again, there were about a hundred
girls who got his second button.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:34.040
How about the basketball
shoes?

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:37.950
I'm the only one
that got a pair!

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:40.610
What kind of
a guy is he?

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:47.290
I've got no problem with myself, but I don't
want to destroy her memories of me.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:51.490
But, why is it that you're asking
me these questions?

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:57.170
Uh... Well, you see, we wanted to make
sure you really knew Officer Aoi.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.220
What do you want
from me?!

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.980
D... Don't touch me!

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:16.020
We're not touching you.

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.160
What do you
want?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.260
Hmm... we're interested
in your sneakers.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:30.570
I was the only one who was
able to escape from them.

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:33.270
I figured maybe Aoi
could help me.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:36.640
And then I remembered
that he was nearby.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.370
Is he not here?
Where is he?

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:41.570
Now, now, take
it easy.

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:45.950
You see, she... I mean... he's
taking a break right now...

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:47.650
Don't worry!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.460
She says that she'll
help out.

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:52.750
Ahh... Ao...

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:54.450
This is Officer
Aoki.

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:55.860
"Aoki?"

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:58.470
Officer Aoki?

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:10.270
What's this "Aoki"
stuff all about?

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:11.740
It's shock
therapy.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:14.610
I think it's more of a shock
just to tell her.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.880
Just changing his outside
won't work.

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:20.580
He has to begin recognizing that
he is a man from the inside.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:25.090
"Kohai;" Junior, opposite of Sempai.
You want him to recall the guy he was
in order to protect a kohai of his?

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.090
That's exactly
right.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:37.430
Um... Tell me, how'd your little brother
get involved with these guys?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.100
Isn't he kind of
small?

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:40.110
Huh?

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:42.800
Didn't you say that he
was really small?

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:46.280
Maybe I'm confusing him
with someone else.

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:47.640
He's in tenth grade.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:51.190
He plays basketball, but
he's not very tall.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:54.320
H... He plays basket-
ball? I see.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:14:00.020
It's because I liked basketball, so
I think I partly forced him into it.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.290
You must have
really liked it...

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:07.560
Actually, it was one particular person
who played basketball...

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:09.640
...that I liked.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:17.240
Oh, no, there
he is!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.770
On the other
bank, huh?

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.850
Coming through!

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:32.490
Look out!

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:36.100
Coming through!

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:43.870
I'm so sorry! Pulling
you in like that.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:06.130
All you have to do is hand over
those sneakers of yours.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:10.930
We've been looking for a while, but they're
at a premium, and we can't find 'em.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:15.160
It's not fair to the sneakers to be worn
by people who don't deserve them.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:17.240
Don't you
think?

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:21.040
No way! They're important
to me, too.

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:27.750
Was the girl who ran away
before your girlfriend?

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.820
What do you mean?

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.440
One of our guys
went to get her.

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:37.390
Girl for sneakers... How
'bout we trade?

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:42.460
Let's decide
now, huh?

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.150
Yuji!

00:16:05.590 --> 00:16:07.420
Let's get outta here! She
brought a cop with her!

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:10.150
Wait a minute. It's
just a woman.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.900
I hope they'll
be okay.

00:16:17.070 --> 00:16:18.590
That's why we followed
them.

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:19.860
Oh! There
they go!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:20.870
Did he get
'em?

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.770
No, they hit
the kid.

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.640
Hey, you
there!

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:32.210
Got 'em.

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.180
Those are...

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:37.720
They're ours
now.

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.350
See ya!

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:43.120
Stop right
there!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:47.900
Pass!

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:50.860
Give them
back!

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:52.190
That's it!

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.130
Got 'em!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:05.250
You okay?

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:06.250
I think so.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.220
Come on, stand up.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:22.290
<i>"Go for it, Aoi!"</i>

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:32.340
Why doesn't she
just punch him?

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:34.980
That's right! Punch
him out!

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:38.510
No. I don't think
he'll do that.

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.080
That's because
he plays fair.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:44.350
Hey!

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.320
Pass!

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.690
Huh?!

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:52.880
Damn!

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:54.220
How dare you!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:59.460
Sempai!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:01.700
Oh, no!

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:03.770
Over here!

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:12.880
Here!

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:48.010
She's wearing boxers!
She's wearing boxers!

00:18:51.490 --> 00:18:54.580
Are you some kind
of homo? Yikes!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.730
You're under
arrest!

00:19:09.970 --> 00:19:11.840
That... That
was fast!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:20.210
No matter what a man
may look like...

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:21.910
...what counts is
what's in here!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:25.080
It just goes to show how shameful
you brutes are.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.930
Good work.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.530
Thank you all.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.930
Thank you so much,
Sempai.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.160
Those shoes
are...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.510
These are the sneakers
I got from you.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:51.700
I wear them as a good
luck charm.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:54.780
But, I'm realizing that I have
a long way to go.

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:56.320
Of course
you do.

00:19:56.490 --> 00:19:58.080
When?

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.650
...did I realize
it was you?

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:03.790
Yes... well...
ahh...

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:07.400
It first occurred to me when you
saved me back on the street.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:10.470
I knew for sure when I saw your
footwork with those hoods.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:16.000
You must've been
disappointed.

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:20.400
Way back when, I suppose you would
have held me in your arms.

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:24.170
But you held my hand. That was
just a little disappointing.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:31.480
But I have to say, you
are still the MVP.

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:34.560
The long shot you just
made was amazing.

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:58.070
"Aoi"

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:02.310
Is this okay? We'll just
set different times.

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:04.250
No objections!

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:07.220
"Jirikihongan Temple"

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:10.450
I see...

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:13.220
So whatever happened to
that... uh, problem?

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:15.490
The changing room
problem?

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.990
We somehow managed
to solve it.

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:24.030
I guess we'll just have to
accept it, you know?

00:21:24.210 --> 00:21:26.640
She even raised an open hand
like a woman, instead of a fist.

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:28.830
She's more ladylike
than we are.

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:30.950
Yoriko! Don't
say that!

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:33.080
Don't say
what?

00:21:40.260 --> 00:21:42.620
Shower times are
separate, too!

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:49.900
Oh, I thought the showers
were okay.

00:22:03.450 --> 00:22:09.580
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:14.090 --> 00:22:18.660
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me Ionely.</i>

00:22:21.400 --> 00:22:29.710
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:37.810
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:39.350 --> 00:22:46.660
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:55.560
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:55.860 --> 00:23:03.090
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:12.810
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:15.840
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:24.090
"Terribly Horrifying"

00:23:26.530 --> 00:23:27.800
We're in big trouble!

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:28.400
Why?

00:23:28.400 --> 00:23:30.130
What, more "big trouble," Yoriko?

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:32.960
Okay, Nakajima, I'm not going to tell
you! Natsumi, Miyuki, you see...

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:34.270
WHAT?! No kidding!

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:34.840
What's up? ...Huh?

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:36.030
Nakajima, good-bye.

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:37.190
Nakajima, I'll never
forget you.

00:23:37.370 --> 00:23:38.070
What?

00:23:38.070 --> 00:23:39.980
If there's anything I can do...

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:42.170
What... Tell me, what?!

00:23:42.340 --> 00:23:46.580
Next time on You're Under Arrest, File 6,
"lnspector Arizuka - The King of Hades."

00:23:46.720 --> 00:23:48.720
Geez! What the hell
is going on!?
